%% Proposed architecture; not deployed in Phase 1
flowchart LR
 Command --> Transaction[Domain write and outbox in one transaction]
 Transaction --> Publisher[Retrying publisher]
 Publisher --> SQS
 SQS --> Worker[Deduplicate event ID]
 Worker --> Commit[Projection and processed ID atomic commit]
 Commit --> Ack[Delete queue message]
 Commit --> Reporting[(Reporting facts)]
 Reporting --> Metabase
 SQS --> DLQ[Poison message DLQ]
